<view class="page"><block wx:if="{{plan}}"><view class="hero card"><text class="caption">{{plan.questionBankName}}</text><text class="hero-title">经验沉淀</text><text class="hero-copy">你老是踩的坑，我们帮你填上</text></view><view class="library card"><view class="library-top"><view class="library-title-wrap"><text class="library-title">我的经验库</text><text wx:if="{{cloudSaved}}" class="cloud-saved">已保存到云端</text></view><view class="action-row"><view wx:if="{{pendingLogId}}" class="undo-icon" bindtap="undoRefinement"><text>↶</text></view><view class="append-button {{actionBusy ? 'append-loading' : ''}}" bindtap="handleAction"><text>{{actionText}}</text></view></view></view><view class="doc-section"><text class="doc-title">思路</text><view class="markdown-doc"><textarea wx:if="{{editing == 'thinking'}}" class="markdown-editor" value="{{library.thinkingMarkdown}}" maxlength="12000" auto-focus bindtap="stopTap" bindinput="inputMarkdown" bindblur="endEdit" data-mode="thinking" placeholder="点击记录可复用的解题思路" /><view wx:else class="markdown-read" bindtap="beginEdit" data-mode="thinking"><rich-text nodes="{{thinkingNodes}}"></rich-text><text wx:if="{{!library.thinkingMarkdown}}" class="empty-hint">点击此处，记录你的解题思路</text></view></view></view><view class="doc-section"><text class="doc-title">语法</text><view class="markdown-doc"><textarea wx:if="{{editing == 'syntax'}}" class="markdown-editor syntax-editor" value="{{library.syntaxMarkdown}}" maxlength="12000" auto-focus bindtap="stopTap" bindinput="inputMarkdown" bindblur="endEdit" data-mode="syntax" placeholder="点击记录语言语法、标准库或工具用法" /><view wx:else class="markdown-read" bindtap="beginEdit" data-mode="syntax"><rich-text nodes="{{syntaxNodes}}"></rich-text><text wx:if="{{!library.syntaxMarkdown}}" class="empty-hint">点击此处，记录你的语法与工具用法</text></view></view></view><view class="library-foot"><text wx:if="{{saving}}">正在自动保存…</text><text wx:else>点击内容即可编辑，离开后自动保存</text></view></view></block><view wx:else class="empty card"><text>创建计划后，可在这里沉淀你的解题经验。</text></view><view wx:if="{{notice}}" class="notice-mask"><view class="notice-dialog" catchtap="stopTap"><text class="notice-title">{{notice.title}}</text><text wx:if="{{notice.isLetter}}" class="letter-greeting">亲爱的码农：</text><text class="notice-content">{{notice.content}}</text><text wx:if="{{notice.isLetter}}" class="letter-signature">——爱你的码秘💗</text><view class="notice-confirm" bindtap="dismissNotice"><text>{{notice.confirmText}}</text></view></view></view></view>
